  "id": "factorial-analysis-of-variance",
  "term": "factorial analysis of variance",
  "definition": "Factorial analysis of variance is a research method framework that can be used for network meta-analysis and for checking whether results are inconsistent. In this context, it organizes comparisons in a way that makes those analyses convenient to carry out.",
